          <div data-page-node-id="ubgI4QNdiQuaJlJc0fd3pY"><div class="label" data-page-node-id="4MBPUzzCe2xYvj33v2g50s">下载本地版 HTML</div><div class="desc" data-page-node-id="CK2gtHVsTRLgad6iSgeIyK">保存到本地浏览器打开，<b data-page-node-id="MULIfkoRqtBNO5IeGmH8HG">完全脱离 WorkBuddy 平台</b>，无登录、无云端同步，数据存本地</div></div>
